 starts with a prayer, a kitschy video in which he asks for a hand giving the audience a show weâ€™ll never forget, before emerging in a puff of dry ice. Stained glass behind him and twinkling fairy lights all around, itâ€™s half seedy club, half church service as he barrels into Risk It All. Is this show meant to be a spaghetti western or a 50s high school prom? The Romantic Tour bravely asks: why not both?</p> <a href="https://www.theguardian.com/music/2026/jul/19/bruno-mars-review-wembley-stadium-london-romantic-tour">Continue reading...</a>ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;avWqn62d02wfj4OCqvL1pzB_94JPAq7fqA2gxX6H-qEƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkx9ni:///sha-256;XmbDv6Q68tlfOFr0Fr3991dGM49P11uwWEiAzQUiO7Aƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;gFTI7nDC_57LwpZdUclmgKFCERi2RBTyTVzhoXxF6zAƒdpairƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmark`ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;bi6AhJXR3pA-FInlTbAR27qdZZ8NDaH6iBSNPo2FAOgƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmarkefalseƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;UVVGqq0cBl3Ysn8b3HybVRgs5BpMS_8IutHg8Vbqmzsƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmarkdtrueƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;PjJDApk4TUFGYCwNVDSe3bc_ev-lg9-aoRHuW00zWTsƒdpairƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmark`ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;6OqkYnj_TlzcM96eW7tSPy8chpAlZOboBrcQAe45j4kƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkdTextƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;xVt2vNGbic4x24EwhZecTyW94WsfC2cdXwHeiXbdDCQƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkqSyndicationSourceƒdpairƒhconstant‚db